#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:4
#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:14
msgid "Notation"
msgstr "符号说明"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page summarizes the notations used throughout the theory pages of "
"this chapter; the same notation is used in the accompanying research "
"report. Symbols not listed here are explained where they first appear."
msgstr ""
"本页汇总了本章理论页面中使用的记号；配套的研究报告亦采用同一套记号。未列出的"
"符号将在首次出现处具体说明。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:15
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:16
msgid ":math:`\\N`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:17
msgid "the set of natural numbers (including :math:`0`)"
msgstr "自然数集（包括 :math:`0`）"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:18
msgid ":math:`\\R`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:19
msgid "the set of real numbers"
msgstr "实数集"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:20
msgid ":math:`\\R^d`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:21
msgid "the :math:`d`-dimensional real vector space (of column vectors)"
msgstr "实 :math:`d` 维列向量空间"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:22
msgid ":math:`\\# S`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:23
msgid "the cardinality of a finite set :math:`S`"
msgstr "有限集合 :math:`S` 的元素个数"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:24
msgid ":math:`\\Pi_{\\Omega}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:25
msgid "the projection map onto a convex set :math:`\\Omega \\subseteq \\R^d`"
msgstr "向凸集 :math:`\\Omega \\subseteq \\R^d` 投影的投影映射"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:26
msgid ":math:`[K]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:27
msgid "the set :math:`\\{1, 2, \\ldots, K\\}`, where :math:`K \\in \\N_{> 0}`"
msgstr "集合 :math:`\\{1, 2, \\ldots, K\\}`，其中 :math:`K \\in \\N_{> 0}`"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:28
msgid ":math:`\\theta`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:29
msgid "the model parameters, :math:`\\theta \\in \\R^d`"
msgstr "模型的参数，:math:`\\in \\R^d`"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:30
msgid ":math:`\\col(\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:31
msgid ""
"the column vector stacking :math:`\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` "
"vertically in order"
msgstr "列向量 :math:`\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` 按顺序竖排在一起形成的列向量"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:32
msgid ":math:`\\operatorname{dom}(f)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:33
msgid ""
"the domain of the function :math:`f`, i.e. :math:`\\{\\theta \\in \\R^d "
"~|~ f(\\theta) < +\\infty\\}`"
msgstr "函数 :math:`f` 的定义域，即 :math:`\\{\\theta \\in \\R^d ~|~ f(\\theta) < +\\infty\\}`"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:34
msgid ":math:`\\nabla f(\\cdot)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:35
msgid "the gradient of :math:`f`"
msgstr "函数 :math:`f` 的梯度"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:36
msgid ":math:`\\partial f(\\cdot)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:37
msgid "the subdifferential (the set of subgradients) of :math:`f`"
msgstr "函数 :math:`f` 的次微分（次梯度的集合）"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:38
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{D}(x, y)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:39
msgid ""
"the (joint) distribution of the data, where :math:`x` is the feature and "
":math:`y` is the label"
msgstr "数据的（联合）分布（Distribution），:math:`x` 是特征（Feature），:math:`y` 是标签（Label）"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:40
msgid ":math:`I_n` or :math:`I`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:41
msgid "the identity matrix (of order :math:`n`)"
msgstr "（:math:`n` 阶）单位矩阵"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:42
msgid ":math:`O_n` or :math:`O`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:43
msgid "the zero matrix (of order :math:`n`)"
msgstr "（:math:`n` 阶）零矩阵"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:44
msgid ":math:`A^{\\mathrm{T}}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:45
msgid "the transpose of a matrix :math:`A`"
msgstr "矩阵 :math:`A` 的转置矩阵"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:46
msgid ":math:`A^{-1}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:47
msgid "the inverse of a matrix :math:`A`"
msgstr "矩阵 :math:`A` 的逆矩阵"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:48
msgid ":math:`\\lVert \\cdot \\rVert_p`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:49
msgid ""
"the :math:`p`-norm of a vector or a matrix (:math:`0 \\leqslant p "
"\\leqslant +\\infty`); when the subscript :math:`p` is omitted, the "
":math:`2`-norm is meant"
msgstr ""
"向量或矩阵的 :math:`p`-范数（:math:`0 \\leqslant p \\leqslant +\\infty`）；"
"当下标 :math:`p` 省略时，表示向量或矩阵的 :math:`2`-范数"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:51
msgid ":math:`\\lVert \\cdot \\rVert_F`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:52
msgid "the Frobenius norm of a matrix"
msgstr "矩阵的 Frobenius 范数"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:53
msgid ":math:`\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:54
msgid "the mathematical expectation"
msgstr "数学期望"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:55
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{N}(\\mu, \\sigma^2)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:56
msgid ""
"the univariate normal distribution with mean :math:`\\mu \\in \\R` and "
"variance :math:`\\sigma^2 \\in \\R`"
msgstr "均值为 :math:`\\mu \\in \\R`、方差为 :math:`\\sigma^2 \\in \\R` 的一维正态分布"

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:57
msgid ":math:`\\mathcal{N}(v, \\Sigma)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/notation.rst:58
msgid ""
"the :math:`d`-dimensional normal distribution with mean :math:`v \\in "
"\\R^d` and covariance matrix :math:`\\Sigma \\in \\R^{d \\times d}`"
msgstr ""
"均值为 :math:`v \\in \\R^d`、协方差矩阵为 :math:`\\Sigma \\in \\R^{d \\times d}` "
"的 :math:`d` 维正态分布"
